The BashKitten cat icon in assets/bashkitten.svg and its generated raster variants
are original BashKitten material under GPL-3.0-only, reused unchanged from the
Android VectorDrawable in BashKitten commit 571b446. The SVG is the preferred
source; scripts/render-branding.py produces the native icon sizes during builds.

Retained WildBuzzard branding and wordmark material is distributed under
AGPL-3.0-or-later. Historical WildBuzzard artwork remains credited to the
WildBuzzard project; rebuilding replaces its old raster logo with BashKitten's
cat icon. Inherited Mozilla document artwork retains its own MPL-2.0 headers.
